flowchart LR
    S[Sensor / Productor] --> QIN[(Artemis Queue<br/>agroalert.eventos)]
    QIN --> CAMEL[Apache Camel<br/>AgroAlertRoute]
    CAMEL --> TR[Message Translator<br/>JSON -> EventoSensor]
    TR --> ID[Idempotent Receiver]
    ID --> DB[(PostgreSQL<br/>sensor_event / alert)]
    ID --> FIL{Message Filter<br/>valor < 10 o > 45}
    FIL -->|Extremo| QEXT[(eventos.extremos)]
    FIL --> CBR{Content-Based Router}
    CBR -->|Humedad < 20| CRIT[CRITICA]
    CBR -->|Temperatura > 35| HIGH[ALTA]
    CBR -->|Otro| QN[(eventos.normales)]

    CRIT --> RL1[Recipient List<br/>email + sms]
    HIGH --> RL2[Recipient List<br/>email]
    RL1 --> QE[(notificacion.email)]
    RL1 --> QS[(notificacion.sms)]
    RL2 --> QE

    CRIT --> WT1[Wire Tap]
    HIGH --> WT2[Wire Tap]
    WT1 --> QA[(auditoria)]
    WT2 --> QA

    CRIT --> QC[(alertas.criticas)]
    HIGH --> QH[(alertas)]

    CRIT --> TOP[(Topic<br/>agroalert.notificaciones)]
    HIGH --> TOP
    TOP --> MON[Suscriptor Monitoreo]
    TOP --> AUD[Suscriptor Auditoria]

    CAMEL -. error .-> DLQ[(agroalert.dlq)]

    HTTP[Cliente HTTP] --> JETTY[Jetty / Camel<br/>GET /agroalert/estado]
    JETTY --> HTTP
